AI models
---------
IAT — Illumination-Adaptive Transformer (low-light enhancement / exposure correction)
  Authors: Ziteng Cui et al. (BMVC 2022), https://github.com/cuiziteng/Illumination-Adaptive-Transformer
  License: Apache License 2.0
  The model files published in this project's "models-v0.1" release (iat_exposure.onnx, iat_lowlight.onnx) are the authors' official
  pretrained weights (IAT_enhance/best_Epoch_exposure.pth and best_Epoch_lol_v1.pth) converted to ONNX with scripts/export_iat.py.
  Changes: export to ONNX only (no retraining); inference wrapper rewritten without a Python loop over the batch.

